# Commit Message Style

- Write a short, descriptive subject line in English.
- Target: a single line with max 72 characters (excluding Git hook branch prefix).
- Avoid generic subjects like `update`, `changes`, `wip`, `auto`.
- Use a verb plus concrete intent (why), not just a file list.
- Optional body only when needed (1-3 short bullets).

## Beispiele

- Good: `Block excludedDates in rolling lock window`
- Good: `Decouple exclusion selection from visibility window`
- Bad: `update`
- Bad: `fix stuff`
